         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang="Latn en">
               <pb n="CC"/>
               <lb n="1" rend="left-to-right"/>Now, indeed, thus I sent (word) to you (2) this (1)
               day <lb n="2" rend="left-to-right"/>on the boat of Pmhn, saying, “I shall enter Syene
                  <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right"/>this d&lt;a>y. Now, indeed, according to SKYˀ <lb
                  n="4" rend="left-to-right"/>[...]◦ this d&lt;a>y. If you (m) are able to make <lb
                  n="5" rend="left-to-right"/>[...] on Pesach, and arise <lb n="6"
                  rend="left-to-right"/>[...]which I shall establish you with <lb n="7"
                  rend="left-to-right"/>[...] and his vessels. Test <lb n="8" rend="left-to-right"
               />[...]my inquiry </ab>
            <ab xml:lang="Latn en">
               <pb n="CV"/>
               <lb n="1" rend="left-to-right"/>[...]which I gave to him <lb n="2"
                  rend="left-to-right"/>[...] you shall be able to make <lb n="3"
                  rend="left-to-right"/>[...] Now, look at it <lb n="4" rend="left-to-right"
               />[...]... son of ..., saying <lb n="5" rend="left-to-right"/>[...]... he sent you
               MYK <lb n="6" rend="left-to-right"/>Indeed the word of a document is it, which <lb
                  n="7" rend="left-to-right"/>Rauk (6) sent (7) to me. And I sent to interpret for
               me <lb n="8" rend="left-to-right"/>the word. Surely, I sent to him to show <lb n="9"
                  rend="left-to-right"/>the decree/decision to Hoshea. </ab>
         </div>
